{"id":"9ab26a4ec0de4af8","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-assignment.md","title":"Variable assignment (legacy)","display":"df-assignment — Variable assignment (legacy)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-assignment","aliases":["27-df-assignment"],"display":"df-assignment — Variable assignment (legacy)","depends_on":["[[27-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-assignment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-assignment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-assignment — Variable assignment (legacy)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea25e09b331cbbdb\" href=\"?note=ea25e09b331cbbdb\" title=\"27-df-structure\">27-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea25e09b331cbbdb\" href=\"?note=ea25e09b331cbbdb\" title=\"27-df-structure\">27-df-structure</a> 及其内建签名上游。</li>\n<li>引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>。赋值更新的合法输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to A\">\\(\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\coloneqq A^{\\mathrm{Var}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\coloneqq A^{\\mathrm{Var}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta[a/x]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,b\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\times A\\mid(y=x\\land b=a)\\lor(y\\neq x\\land b=\\beta(y))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta[a/x]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,b\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\times A\\mid(y=x\\land b=a)\\lor(y\\neq x\\land b=\\beta(y))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是目录遗留的一阶逻辑背景（legacy background），不是《Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications》的书内对应原子。本次保留其概念接口并修复类型、绑定和依赖；未取得该书的对应定义或页码，不声称依据原书核验。</li>\n<li>将旧 Remark 才出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta,a,x,y\">\\(\\beta,a,x,y\\)</span> 类型移到 Hypothesis。图定义使更新在整个 Var 上覆盖且单值，仍属于同一赋值集合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"ea25e09b331cbbdb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"ea25e09b331cbbdb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$\\mathrm{Var}$ 见 [[27-df-structure]] 及其内建签名上游。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\coloneqq A^{\\mathrm{Var}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta[a/x]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,b\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\times A\\mid(y=x\\land b=a)\\lor(y\\neq x\\land b=\\beta(y))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta,a,x,y","display":false}],"bytes":1246,"backlinks":[{"id":"81e99b41571ec995","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 见 [[27-df-formula]]；赋值与满足见 [[27-df-assignment]]、[[27-df-satisfaction]]。引入同签名子结构关系 $\\subseteq_S$、初等子结构关系 $\\preccurlyeq_S$；$\\mathfrak B\\subseteq\\mathfrak A$ 在本原子仅为 $\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_S\\mathfrak A$ 的局部别名。"},{"id":"fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$；见 [[27-df-structure]]、[[27-df-assignment]]。"},{"id":"1530bb34c38bf5bb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 及符号解释见 [[27-df-structure]]；$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$ 见 [[27-df-assignment]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-assignment|df-assignment — Variable assignment (legacy)]]"}],"outgoing":["ea25e09b331cbbdb"]}